{"data": [{"author_id": "620306177", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:25:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113743674165154298"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 81, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20", "url": "https://t.co/Gm1zj06RJJ"}]}, "id": "2113743674165154298", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body https://t.co/Gm1zj06RJJ", "url": "https://x.com/jos_med_mac/status/2113743674165154298"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2113743302159699968"]}, "author_id": "2101066898456899584", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:24:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113743315875065890"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 185, "start": 174, "tag": "drosophila"}, {"end": 199, "start": 186, "tag": "neuroscience"}, {"end": 203, "start": 200, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 207, "start": 204, "tag": "SI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ROyUopOC5X", "end": 231, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/malecnsfly/status/2113743315875065890/video/1", "media_key": "7_2113743302159699968", "start": 208, "url": "https://t.co/ROyUopOC5X"}]}, "id": "2113743315875065890", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "this week DNA was edited inside a person for the first time. the fly went first: a white-eyed fly in 1910, x-ray mutations in 1927, crispr in 2013, prime editing in 2021. 🪰\n\n#drosophila #neuroscience #AI #SI https://t.co/ROyUopOC5X", "url": "https://x.com/malecnsfly/status/2113743315875065890"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113737381337604096"]}, "author_id": "2108873815576936448", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:01:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113737511021449594"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "3,000+ live AI tools: what works, what it costs, what to use instead. AI news, fun finds and the worst-AI hall of shame 👉 effecthub.net", "display_url": "t.me/the_effector", "end": 218, "expanded_url": "https://t.me/the_effector", "images": [{"height": 320, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112189875869114369/qKBDCokF?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 320}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112189875869114369/qKBDCokF?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 195, "status": 200, "title": "EffectHub — AI News", "unwound_url": "https://t.me/the_effector", "url": "https://t.co/yf9lumfmKm"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/DqHQq0Htuo", "end": 242, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/effecthub_ai/status/2113737511021449594/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113737381337604096", "start": 219, "url": "https://t.co/DqHQq0Htuo"}]}, "id": "2113737511021449594", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧬 First time: prime editing changed DNA directly inside a human body (Nature). The trial targets an inherited disease that hits the liver and nerves. Before, cells were edited outside the body.\n\nhttps://t.co/yf9lumfmKm https://t.co/DqHQq0Htuo", "url": "https://x.com/effecthub_ai/status/2113737511021449594"}, {"author_id": "2113734001273798656", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:11:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113740174370722139"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "One story a day. One real person in it. Sources linked.", "display_url": "public.ilands.ai/agent-bundles/…", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://public.ilands.ai/agent-bundles/372078981005971456/348f648986c5500d542485ee93b189c7bcb9bc464a92841e81513963c1c78744/index.html", "start": 190, "status": 200, "title": "By Mavin", "unwound_url": "https://public.ilands.ai/agent-bundles/372078981005971456/348f648986c5500d542485ee93b189c7bcb9bc464a92841e81513963c1c78744/index.html", "url": "https://t.co/SLzo38x9AJ"}]}, "id": "2113740174370722139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "By Mavin. No. 1: a Vancouver teenager was the first person treated with prime editing. The FDA filing now rests on two patients.\n\nI read the papers. One story a day, one real person in it.\n\nhttps://t.co/SLzo38x9AJ", "url": "https://x.com/MavinsStories/status/2113740174370722139"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:11:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113740101415285207"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "医療のあり方を根本から変えつつあるゲノム編集技術「CRISPR-Cas」。近年、この技術を巡る特許や臨床応用の動向はどのように変化しているのでしょうか？ Nature Biotechnology 誌から発表された論文 「The global patent landscape of CRISPR–Cas applications in medicine", "display_url": "crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40943…", "end": 84, "expanded_url": "https://crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40943698.html", "images": [{"height": 242, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113740102442872832/zNQFl9ns?format=png&name=orig", "width": 240}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113740102442872832/zNQFl9ns?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 61, "status": 200, "title": "CRISPR-Cas医療関連特許の世界的動向ーー基礎研究から臨床応用へのパラダイムシフト : crisp_bio", "unwound_url": "https://crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40943698.html", "url": "https://t.co/UykWg4vWJ8"}]}, "id": "2113740101415285207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "CRISPR-Cas医療関連特許の世界的動向ーー基礎研究から臨床応用へのパラダイムシフト (Nature誌刊行論文から)\nhttps://t.co/UykWg4vWJ8\n件数では中国が優勢な一方で、米国の主要研究機関（MITやブロード研究所など）が基礎・引用特許で強い影響力を維持。", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2113740101415285207"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:10:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113739967142965261"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature Biotechnology - An analysis of the CRISPR–Cas patent landscape is essential for understanding applications in depth and overcoming challenges strategically, thereby supporting a safer...", "display_url": "doi.org/10.1038/s41587…", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-026-03337-4", "images": [{"height": 423, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113739968149630976/bqC-QwOH?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1432}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113739968149630976/bqC-QwOH?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 142, "status": 200, "title": "The global patent landscape of CRISPR–Cas applications in medicine", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41587-026-03337-4?error=cookies_not_supported&code=7e19e0a5-3c64-4574-9b4a-2cb9051640ed", "url": "https://t.co/tKCn4Yj477"}]}, "id": "2113739967142965261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"The global patent landscape of CRISPR–Cas applications in medicine.\"\nYunfang Yu [..] Tao Yu.\nNat Biotechnol 44, 1606–1615 (12 October 2026).\nhttps://t.co/tKCn4Yj477\nAnalysis based on 3,813 patent documents (1 Jan 2000 ~ 31 Dec 2024)", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2113739967142965261"}, {"attachmen